# Evaluations

Unit tests do not measure probabilistic behavior. Keep deterministic assertions and AI evaluation distinct.

Version the dataset, the metric, the prompt, the model, and the retrieval config. Run a baseline and a candidate. Keep the artifacts.

Useful methods include exact checks, schema validation, golden sets, retrieval metrics, reference answers, heuristics, human review, and LLM-as-judge. LLM-as-judge is a noisy instrument, not ground truth.

Report quality, latency, and cost. Analyze failures before recommending a change. Do not change a production prompt or model on anecdote alone.
